# Heiken — Netlify SPA fallback.
# React Router owns the routes (/login, /library, /watch/..., etc.). On a
# static host every unknown path must serve the app shell (index.html), or
# reloading/deep-linking shows Netlify's "Page not found". API paths are
# NOT rewritten — the engine lives elsewhere (VITE_API_BASE_URL).
/* /index.html 200
